msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/versionMemberFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "versionMember is functional"
msgstr "versionMember 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/versionMemberFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:versionMember is functional: each gmeow:VersionMembership is about exactly one concrete version artifact — a different version of the same lineage is its own membership relator, not a second member."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:versionMember 是函数性的:每个 gmeow:VersionMembership 恰好关于一个具体的版本制品——同一谱系的不同版本应有其自己的成员关系元,而不是作为第二个成员。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/versionSetFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "versionSet is functional"
msgstr "versionSet 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/versionSetFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:versionSet is functional: each gmeow:VersionMembership places its member into exactly one lineage, so a membership belongs to a single gmeow:VersionSet. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:versionSet 是函数性的:每个 gmeow:VersionMembership 恰好将其成员归入一个谱系,因此一个成员关系只属于一个 gmeow:VersionSet。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：义务由该记录推理得出，而非在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/versionMemberFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce that gmeow:versionMember names exactly one value; this record is the canonical carrier the gate joins, so the obligation is reasoned rather than restated on a shape surface."
msgstr "当原生一致性门必须强制 gmeow:versionMember 恰好命名一个值 时使用；该记录是门所连接的规范载体，因此该义务是被推理出来的，而非在形状表面上重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/versionMemberFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid this record when a second value would make the record ambiguous — retire the assertion instead of weakening it, and never mirror it as a hand-authored shape."
msgstr "当第二个值会使该记录产生歧义时避免使用该记录——应撤回该断言而非削弱它，且绝不将其复刻为手写形状。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/versionMemberFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Read together with logic:characteristicSort: the pair (logic:characterizes gmeow:versionMember, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) is the whole obligation, and the OWL grounding view projects the matching characteristic from it."
msgstr "与 logic:characteristicSort 一并阅读：(logic:characterizes gmeow:versionMember, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) 这一对构成完整义务，OWL 基础视图据此投影出相应特征。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/versionMemberFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:versionMemberFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:versionMember ."
msgstr "gmeow:versionMemberFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:versionMember ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/versionSetFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce that gmeow:versionSet names exactly one value; this record is the canonical carrier the gate joins, so the obligation is reasoned rather than restated on a shape surface."
msgstr "当原生一致性门必须强制 gmeow:versionSet 恰好命名一个值 时使用；该记录是门所连接的规范载体，因此该义务是被推理出来的，而非在形状表面上重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/versionSetFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid this record when a second value would make the record ambiguous — retire the assertion instead of weakening it, and never mirror it as a hand-authored shape."
msgstr "当第二个值会使该记录产生歧义时避免使用该记录——应撤回该断言而非削弱它，且绝不将其复刻为手写形状。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/versionSetFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Read together with logic:characteristicSort: the pair (logic:characterizes gmeow:versionSet, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) is the whole obligation, and the OWL grounding view projects the matching characteristic from it."
msgstr "与 logic:characteristicSort 一并阅读：(logic:characterizes gmeow:versionSet, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) 这一对构成完整义务，OWL 基础视图据此投影出相应特征。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/versionSetFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:versionSetFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:versionSet ."
msgstr "gmeow:versionSetFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:versionSet ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/versionMemberFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Scope: this record carries ONE integrity obligation about gmeow:versionMember and nothing else. It is not a definition of gmeow:versionMember (that lives on the term itself), not a shape, and not a second place to state the term's meaning — retire the record rather than broaden it."
msgstr "范围：该记录仅承载关于 gmeow:versionMember 的一项完整性义务，别无其他。它不是 gmeow:versionMember 的定义（定义位于术语自身），不是形状，也不是重述该术语含义的第二处位置——应撤回该记录而非扩大其范围。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/versionSetFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Scope: this record carries ONE integrity obligation about gmeow:versionSet and nothing else. It is not a definition of gmeow:versionSet (that lives on the term itself), not a shape, and not a second place to state the term's meaning — retire the record rather than broaden it."
msgstr "范围：该记录仅承载关于 gmeow:versionSet 的一项完整性义务，别无其他。它不是 gmeow:versionSet 的定义（定义位于术语自身），不是形状，也不是重述该术语含义的第二处位置——应撤回该记录而非扩大其范围。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/versionLabel|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to record an entity's version designation as it is actually written."
msgstr "用于按实际书写形式记录实体的版本标识。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/versionLabel|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid parsing it into components or ordering by it — it is a label, not a comparable version structure."
msgstr "避免将其解析为组成部分或据以排序——它是标签，而非可比较的版本结构。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/versionLabel|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "A plain literal on any gmeow:Entity: a release, a book edition, a dataset, a language variant."
msgstr "在任意 gmeow:Entity 上以普通字面量表示：软件发行版、图书版次、数据集或语言变体。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/versionLabel|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:release1 gmeow:versionLabel \"v2.1.0-beta\" ."
msgstr "gmeow:release1 gmeow:versionLabel \"v2.1.0-beta\" ."
